<title>FRANCE: CLF shareholders accept CCB merger.</title>
<headline>CLF shareholders accept CCB merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An extraordinary shareholders meeting of Credit Local de France (CLF) on Wednesday accepted by majority vote a proposed merger with Belgium's Credit Communal de Belgique (CCB).</p>
<p>CCB shareholders still have to agree to the merger at their meeting of October 14.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
